{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:46:54Z","created_by_operation":"op_e775d352a54d4019ae9f79bd4173526a","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_36a5ed3e9704f37086540a816ed55e0329a139ae6e9737707a9d9d62337cea1e","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=interfaces","setting":"dicklesworthstone/coding_agent_account_manager@ef01b6411acc snapshot 111e1c3e595f5ddc","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_7867f98ef3141b9fe4781bf5159d99f4501f01af308a3da44b1a5fc41773161a"],"source_ids":["src_6252bacc1d7f5756a69aa2a83603051d"],"text":"Shallow-profile subcommands include shallow-profile create/list/delete/sync-config and shallow-spawn with flags like --create, --print-env, --allow-agent-view, --no-sync-config, and --effort.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:46:54Z","updated_by_operation":"op_e775d352a54d4019ae9f79bd4173526a"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:46:54Z","created_by_operation":"op_e775d352a54d4019ae9f79bd4173526a","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_40265e8b48798c44c2b45abeacc674801c5123972da001ddc7ac25cd5296bf3a","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=design-choices","setting":"dicklesworthstone/coding_agent_account_manager@ef01b6411acc snapshot 111e1c3e595f5ddc","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_4e79534acd16b66fa1580bf6fc3b2fd687b20eec7531382d2291736d5093b0e6","slc_641e7f991a61c3fb90069ba6a046c20e3a26ff75bc78734a09c331182a94f438","slc_8aa5a84a0d784b001c2a1d2b7cca18140492cf889951a6bb3a7987f42c2dd236"],"source_ids":["src_6252bacc1d7f5756a69aa2a83603051d"],"text":"The tool works by backing up and restoring the plain OAuth token files each AI CLI stores, so switching is effectively file copying with no browser or OAuth flow.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:46:54Z","updated_by_operation":"op_e775d352a54d4019ae9f79bd4173526a"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:46:54Z","created_by_operation":"op_e775d352a54d4019ae9f79bd4173526a","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_419a3697db872a8869898d6cddd00bdd375b2d274cad958368eeabbb18405fc5","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=design-choices","setting":"dicklesworthstone/coding_agent_account_manager@ef01b6411acc snapshot 111e1c3e595f5ddc","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_550c5dc6977731d402220c3ba1209d12a58dc67d4929bdeb180db45447b41687"],"source_ids":["src_6252bacc1d7f5756a69aa2a83603051d"],"text":"In isolated profiles, dev tooling like ~/.ssh and ~/.gitconfig is symlinked to the real home while provider auth directories are real and isolated, and ~/.local/share/caam is never passed through.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:46:54Z","updated_by_operation":"op_e775d352a54d4019ae9f79bd4173526a"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:46:54Z","created_by_operation":"op_e775d352a54d4019ae9f79bd4173526a","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_46e49be9d825259b1591b490c741d3715144d372c16113f09f4a95aced7ebdc4","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=interfaces","setting":"dicklesworthstone/coding_agent_account_manager@ef01b6411acc snapshot 111e1c3e595f5ddc","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_58c360805d637df21861f450045a2f89d35595141e1fa2bcd127d8e8de34395e","slc_966a4f10e7e5c6b96ae5b5ce1ca41588adc2807a186a2ca6f3ffdb6526cbbe91","slc_f9d66cee41a8b5a681d07f606d9e5211d3e43656bad64b7d1ced0cbe975b643b"],"source_ids":["src_6252bacc1d7f5756a69aa2a83603051d"],"text":"caam limits supports --cached to read Claude's on-disk usage snapshot without network or token presentation, --rank earliest-reset-headroom for seat selection, and --profile/--source to read vault, isolated, or shallow credential namespaces.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:46:54Z","updated_by_operation":"op_e775d352a54d4019ae9f79bd4173526a"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:46:54Z","created_by_operation":"op_e775d352a54d4019ae9f79bd4173526a","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_55bd1bc05381f812b30e069bd7cb7ec3e6ff14fc2dc51aef5e4ec9e5ba5ed17d","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=relevance","setting":"dicklesworthstone/coding_agent_account_manager@ef01b6411acc snapshot 111e1c3e595f5ddc","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_bb338907381b24f8525faec4ad8f66ca8d5a2306e9f362e26ed3b3378c751b62","slc_bd954341581ba2e09a8072a795663d725612425a93f194516ca1c06ae0657c43","slc_e9e12c6b37c6cb6e23e6c1d6d171ffb00a89182c3dd6d9c3e4f802211031d9f7"],"source_ids":["src_6252bacc1d7f5756a69aa2a83603051d"],"text":"The tool targets users of fixed-cost AI coding subscriptions (Claude Max, GPT Pro, Gemini Ultra) who hit rate limits and want sub-100ms account switching instead of a 30-60 second browser OAuth flow.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:46:54Z","updated_by_operation":"op_e775d352a54d4019ae9f79bd4173526a"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:46:54Z","created_by_operation":"op_e775d352a54d4019ae9f79bd4173526a","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_5bffbef36bddd7ccec7e38fd71b90de5c837480322111bb294db7db1e7807a51","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=components","setting":"dicklesworthstone/coding_agent_account_manager@ef01b6411acc snapshot 111e1c3e595f5ddc","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_99404fe12676575ed157ef4cf41d02c47f3a05b869d558fe8b7f9ae47ba648bb","slc_ee6be8328c5fba75e6d2fcdb4fc8840e23ded529209fecf6a37834244cb94fd6"],"source_ids":["src_6252bacc1d7f5756a69aa2a83603051d"],"text":"Profiles live in a vault under ~/.local/share/caam/vault/ organized per provider and account name, mirroring auth files from locations like ~/.claude.json and ~/.codex/auth.json.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:46:54Z","updated_by_operation":"op_e775d352a54d4019ae9f79bd4173526a"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:46:54Z","created_by_operation":"op_e775d352a54d4019ae9f79bd4173526a","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_61d72132e9db821aeb2ad9a4607c632f210829caef14e600dea2c2754f29f920","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=design-choices","setting":"dicklesworthstone/coding_agent_account_manager@ef01b6411acc snapshot 111e1c3e595f5ddc","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_7b7eedf5fb2017932d847107ed3ce2135eb7c85935f765c06ac7b0d78859a853","slc_947cedee38dbccb7bd8acdf1288f8ea294ff87814a00e964e56364df00e6086e","slc_964587d703782ac0c84a8e196ee0a9b889bbd9ef904ae2913959930b03805bba"],"source_ids":["src_6252bacc1d7f5756a69aa2a83603051d"],"text":"Three profile modes are offered: vault profiles for sequential switching, isolated profiles with full directory isolation for parallel sessions, and shallow profiles that isolate only auth-bearing files.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:46:54Z","updated_by_operation":"op_e775d352a54d4019ae9f79bd4173526a"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:46:54Z","created_by_operation":"op_e775d352a54d4019ae9f79bd4173526a","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_76e8d1d77ee2480b6ea8e62bc21fd29625cef0fbd18e8a7b9417b4aeaf9d3ee2","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=design-choices","setting":"dicklesworthstone/coding_agent_account_manager@ef01b6411acc snapshot 111e1c3e595f5ddc","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_089dee8ae7808e5771c451f49b4e73bf49cf13e050b20ba31d7557cc209af3b8","slc_72b59c9b1cddf7d7334e4f606bf658cb7bdee5aa3f3d83464c6d83f01af19497"],"source_ids":["src_6252bacc1d7f5756a69aa2a83603051d"],"text":"Unknown shallow-spawn names are errors rather than implicit profile creation, with --create required to provision a new empty identity, preventing mistyped names from spawning wrong-account logins.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:46:54Z","updated_by_operation":"op_e775d352a54d4019ae9f79bd4173526a"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:46:54Z","created_by_operation":"op_e775d352a54d4019ae9f79bd4173526a","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_7c8a3061de48993dddec3b8e4735c075a5b725e2f382559ad971298aa6887485","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=interfaces","setting":"dicklesworthstone/coding_agent_account_manager@ef01b6411acc snapshot 111e1c3e595f5ddc","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_10b6cb9b8af017141b8900eb9634297023c9a76eccdbb9ba050241019b1eeff1"],"source_ids":["src_6252bacc1d7f5756a69aa2a83603051d"],"text":"A --json flag is provided for agent contexts, with stdout carrying data, stderr diagnostics, and exit code 0 signaling success.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:46:54Z","updated_by_operation":"op_e775d352a54d4019ae9f79bd4173526a"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:46:54Z","created_by_operation":"op_e775d352a54d4019ae9f79bd4173526a","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_7faf76c22bc358d18ee77a36b2866f1b06130b193034f70f82eab13ee36d878b","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=components","setting":"dicklesworthstone/coding_agent_account_manager@ef01b6411acc snapshot 111e1c3e595f5ddc","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_8aa5a84a0d784b001c2a1d2b7cca18140492cf889951a6bb3a7987f42c2dd236"],"source_ids":["src_6252bacc1d7f5756a69aa2a83603051d"],"text":"The tool uses embedded SQLite, requires no daemon, and an optional background service is available.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:46:54Z","updated_by_operation":"op_e775d352a54d4019ae9f79bd4173526a"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:46:54Z","created_by_operation":"op_e775d352a54d4019ae9f79bd4173526a","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_9c5306f8e2e213ac77bbd900ee5711472b79916d3cd2ec8e580846f7234383e8","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=limitations","setting":"dicklesworthstone/coding_agent_account_manager@ef01b6411acc snapshot 111e1c3e595f5ddc","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_c758fe30aadcfbd3e5f968d2db0ca33646a16b9fcf2a35825a1e683820b8ffcd"],"source_ids":["src_6252bacc1d7f5756a69aa2a83603051d"],"text":"Claude's auth format does not expose email or account ID, so profile names default to timestamp-based auto-names unless a name is given at backup time.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:46:54Z","updated_by_operation":"op_e775d352a54d4019ae9f79bd4173526a"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:46:54Z","created_by_operation":"op_e775d352a54d4019ae9f79bd4173526a","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_ac33731ef52c294bbaba79ce222752af1f4a484837060476a3b3757c5fa8b618","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=dependencies","setting":"dicklesworthstone/coding_agent_account_manager@ef01b6411acc snapshot 111e1c3e595f5ddc","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_05be869798ad3213921b23683c1723e5b780e7e92bd588712d0a9c7a1e1ebc52","slc_067375b80e9ebb15b6dee1dd8e63ebdbeed4ebe2407d3dea8d46c5c729f84b08"],"source_ids":["src_6252bacc1d7f5756a69aa2a83603051d"],"text":"caam pick uses fzf when installed and falls back to a numbered prompt otherwise, so fzf is an optional dependency.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:46:54Z","updated_by_operation":"op_e775d352a54d4019ae9f79bd4173526a"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:46:54Z","created_by_operation":"op_e775d352a54d4019ae9f79bd4173526a","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_b244679893d138bc8d73196c10eebdc30132bd9cd3ca117a59ef1f04900b7271","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=interfaces","setting":"dicklesworthstone/coding_agent_account_manager@ef01b6411acc snapshot 111e1c3e595f5ddc","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_9929ac82d4bd9ae7ef255ab3b334e7397821be7dc0e2e2f2c7363ed63e63b844"],"source_ids":["src_6252bacc1d7f5756a69aa2a83603051d"],"text":"The CLI offers commands including backup, activate, status, ls, delete, paths, clear, alias, rename, and uninstall for managing saved auth profiles.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:46:54Z","updated_by_operation":"op_e775d352a54d4019ae9f79bd4173526a"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:46:54Z","created_by_operation":"op_e775d352a54d4019ae9f79bd4173526a","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_b4c70b8f8b0359a74d4ed917282201ccca6b1dc909fa83e4436c007d0b6f5a8c","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=design-choices","setting":"dicklesworthstone/coding_agent_account_manager@ef01b6411acc snapshot 111e1c3e595f5ddc","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_57aec1bf48fc3d52301276926b5e58691c6b140c2d9e54e044d18b617f846e8b"],"source_ids":["src_6252bacc1d7f5756a69aa2a83603051d"],"text":"On macOS, caam treats the login keychain as authoritative for Claude's OAuth blob, with the credentials file as a 0600 mirror; CAAM_KEYCHAIN=0 disables the bridge.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:46:54Z","updated_by_operation":"op_e775d352a54d4019ae9f79bd4173526a"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:46:54Z","created_by_operation":"op_e775d352a54d4019ae9f79bd4173526a","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_cdd398e29d07e53aee9580ba9f53e68bb99a28b650e3c59a53487547f59ad5b4","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=design-choices","setting":"dicklesworthstone/coding_agent_account_manager@ef01b6411acc snapshot 111e1c3e595f5ddc","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_a66b3cb0b658cac29bdfd45bb0ddeeec14d1ed553575d98d4a62fe7e43e06100"],"source_ids":["src_6252bacc1d7f5756a69aa2a83603051d"],"text":"Shallow-spawn injects CLAUDE_CODE_DISABLE_AGENT_VIEW=1 by default to prevent Claude's background supervisor from bypassing per-identity auth isolation, with --allow-agent-view as an opt-out.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:46:54Z","updated_by_operation":"op_e775d352a54d4019ae9f79bd4173526a"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:46:54Z","created_by_operation":"op_e775d352a54d4019ae9f79bd4173526a","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_ea8ab22dcd4a1bd93c5030626e54fd9b7190d0fad010b1ab597e0eeab3a6c177","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=limitations","setting":"dicklesworthstone/coding_agent_account_manager@ef01b6411acc snapshot 111e1c3e595f5ddc","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_c758fe30aadcfbd3e5f968d2db0ca33646a16b9fcf2a35825a1e683820b8ffcd","slc_db568143ca036c582b6565be273fe168cfb3eac0e2e7581a6f49194736d150e3"],"source_ids":["src_6252bacc1d7f5756a69aa2a83603051d"],"text":"CAAM cannot refresh Claude or Grok tokens; users must re-login via /login or grok login when tokens expire, and Grok tokens expire after 7 days.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:46:54Z","updated_by_operation":"op_e775d352a54d4019ae9f79bd4173526a"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:46:54Z","created_by_operation":"op_e775d352a54d4019ae9f79bd4173526a","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_ebf1b53ae4de74f7cde872003771c4c717d35ac4938a685cb0cd6823c317e0b9","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=design-choices","setting":"dicklesworthstone/coding_agent_account_manager@ef01b6411acc snapshot 111e1c3e595f5ddc","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_7092128930222cf6b698803d8399665373269532ad81b56fe19cd6bcf421885f","slc_92c0b9add2a1dab5ba3b74e2d4c5bcffd57e9ed4c572b4c33c865e290a1d9098","slc_9ca66241d730c8510c07f0c7ef8dde509f19a91ea7988b00deda5f08930ce975"],"source_ids":["src_6252bacc1d7f5756a69aa2a83603051d"],"text":"caam status detects the active profile by SHA-256 hashing current auth files and matching against vault profiles, avoiding hidden state files that could desync.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:46:54Z","updated_by_operation":"op_e775d352a54d4019ae9f79bd4173526a"}
